            <div xml:id="d640">

                <pb facs="0919" n="909" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg909"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/6–2845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-28T14:00:00+03:00">June 28, 1945—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 28—11:34 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2306. Personal for Bohlen. Via Navy I have sent today message to the White House
                    regarding one of the matters Harry and I took up in Moscow. Would appreciate
                    your doing what you can to expedite answers to my questions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
